%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3bb5583713e7feb4f8c632285c080082, type: 3}
  m_Name: TodoBoard
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Todo.TodoBoardSO
  Tasks:
  - Category: Architecture
    Name: Define relic runtime architecture and responsibilities
    Description: DONE - Bag plus Board plus PlayerRelicManager design. Bag holds unplaced instances. Board is a Tetris-style 2D grid where only placed relics are active. PlayerRelicManager owns both and manages all transitions.
    Status: 2
  - Category: Architecture
    Name: Define player stat model with base plus modifiers
    Description: DONE - PlayerStatsModel uses additive and multiplicative modifier pipeline keyed by sourceId for clean relic add and remove.
    Status: 2
  - Category: Data
    Name: Expand RelicSO with id rarity max level and tags
    Description: DONE - RelicSO has Id DisplayName Description Icon Rarity MaxLevel Tags and Levels list.
    Status: 2
  - Category: Data
    Name: Add per level effect values and upgrade weighting data
    Description: DONE - RelicLevelData holds Description and StatModifiers per level.
    Status: 2
  - Category: Data
    Name: Add RelicShape to RelicSO
    Description: DONE - RelicShape class added with Vector2Int Cells array. RelicSO has ShapePerLevel array and GetShape(level) method. Defaults to 1x1 if not set.
    Status: 2
  - Category: Data
    Name: Create RelicCatalogueSO listing all relic definitions
    Description: Build a central catalogue asset used by offer generation and content management. Already has class definition but no asset created and not yet wired to offer system.
    Status: 1
  - Category: Runtime
    Name: Implement RelicInstance runtime state object
    Description: DONE - RelicInstance has Definition Level IsMaxLevel TryLevelUp InstanceId AnchorPosition IsPlaced SetPlaced ClearPlaced CooldownRemaining and BehaviorTimers array. Timer state persists across unequip.
    Status: 2
  - Category: Runtime
    Name: Implement IRelicBehavior lifecycle interface
    Description: DONE - Interface defines OnAcquired OnRemoved OnLevelChanged OnTick OnTrigger. Behaviors are paused not destroyed on unequip so cooldown state survives.
    Status: 2
  - Category: Runtime
    Name: Replace RelicInventory with PlayerRelicManager
    Description: DONE - PlayerRelicManager owns RelicBag and RelicBoard. Only board relics apply modifiers and tick behaviors. Bag relics are inert. IsInteractionLocked blocks moves during gameplay. MergeResult enum covers all merge outcomes including shape conflict.
    Status: 2
  - Category: Runtime
    Name: Implement RelicBag
    Description: DONE - RelicBag is an unordered list of unplaced RelicInstances with OnRelicAdded and OnRelicRemoved events. Multiple copies of same definition allowed.
    Status: 2
  - Category: Runtime
    Name: Implement RelicBoard
    Description: DONE - RelicBoard is a 2D occupancy grid backed by RelicInstance array. TryPlace validates shape fit. Remove clears all cells and calls ClearPlaced. CanPlaceIgnoring supports merge re-shape check. Resize expands board for unlock progression.
    Status: 2
  - Category: Runtime
    Name: Implement PlayerRelicManager
    Description: Owns RelicBag and RelicBoard. Exposes AcquireToBag PlaceOnBoard RemoveFromBoard and MergeOnBoard. Applies and removes stat modifiers when board state changes. Manages behavior lifecycle. Has IsInteractionLocked flag that blocks moves during gameplay. Only board relics tick and receive triggers.
    Status: 0
  - Category: Runtime
    Name: Add event hub for combat and level related relic triggers
    Description: Publish gameplay events such as EnemyKilled PlayerHit ProjectileImpact and LevelUp for relics to subscribe via IRelicBehavior.OnTrigger.
    Status: 0
  - Category: Runtime
    Name: Handle merge shape conflict on upgrade
    Description: When a bag relic is merged onto a board relic the upgraded level may have a larger shape. If the new shape does not fit in the current position warn the player and either block the merge or auto-move the upgraded relic to the bag.
    Status: 0
  - Category: Leveling
    Name: Implement player XP and level progression service
    Description: DONE - PlayerXPService tracks CurrentXP CurrentLevel LevelProgress XPToNextLevel. AddXP fires OnLevelUp for each threshold crossed. Cumulative threshold array configurable via SerializeField on Player.
    Status: 2
  - Category: Leveling
    Name: Trigger acquirement flow when player levels up
    Description: DONE - GameplayState subscribes to PlayerXPService.OnLevelUp. On level up sets _levelUpPending flag then transitions to UpgradeScreenState in Update with fresh RelicOfferGenerator offers. Context flows GameManager -> StartGameState -> MainMenuState -> GameplayState -> UpgradeScreenState.
    Status: 2
  - Category: Upgrades
    Name: Build weighted relic offer generator
    Description: DONE - RelicOfferGenerator uses weighted random selection by RelicRarity. Default weights Common=60 Rare=25 Epic=12 Legendary=3. Configurable via GameManager inspector. Returns unique offers up to requested count with graceful fallback.
    Status: 2
  - Category: Upgrades
    Name: Exclude maxed relics and support upgrade fallback rules
    Description: Offer generator currently returns all relics weighted by rarity. Exclusion of truly-maxed relics deferred to balancing phase. Generator returns all available if pool smaller than requested count.
    Status: 1
  - Category: StateMachine
    Name: Implement UpgradeScreenState
    Description: DONE - Pauses Time.timeScale=0 on enter, unlocks IsInteractionLocked. Exposes Offers list and OnOffersReady OnOfferSelected OnExiting events for Phase-3 UI. SelectOffer adds to bag. Dismiss restores timeScale=1 locks board and transitions back to GameplayState.
    Status: 2
  - Category: StateMachine
    Name: Pause and resume gameplay simulation around inventory
    Description: DONE - UpgradeScreenState.OnEnter sets Time.timeScale=0 and OnExit sets it back to 1. Player.Update passes Time.deltaTime=0 to relic Tick during pause. Enemies also freeze since they read Time.deltaTime.
    Status: 2
  - Category: UI
    Name: Build RelicAcquirementScreenUI
    Description: DONE - Fullscreen overlay with up to 3 RelicCardUI slots. Shows on UpgradeScreenState.OnOffersReady. After selection disables cards and shows Manage Board button. Wired via RelicUICoordinator.
    Status: 2
  - Category: UI
    Name: Build RelicCardUI
    Description: DONE - Shows icon rarity border name and level description. Bind(relic, callback) populates all visuals. Rarity colors configurable in inspector. SelectButton fires callback.
    Status: 2
  - Category: UI
    Name: Build Manage Board button and inventory overlay flow
    Description: DONE - After acquirement selection ShowManageBoardButton appears. Tapping opens InventoryOverlayUI. Close button calls UpgradeScreenState.Dismiss which resumes gameplay.
    Status: 2
  - Category: UI
    Name: Build RelicBoardUI
    Description: DONE - Creates Columns x Rows grid of RelicCellUI from prefab in a GridLayoutGroup. Subscribes to RelicBoard.OnCellChanged and OnBoardResized. Anchor cells show icon and level badge. Other occupied cells show rarity fill. ShowPlacementPreview and ClearPlacementPreview handle drag preview.
    Status: 2
  - Category: UI
    Name: Build BagOfHoldingUI
    Description: DONE - Subscribes to RelicBag.OnRelicAdded and OnRelicRemoved. Spawns and destroys RelicBagItemUI tiles reactively. Implements IDropHandler to accept board relics dragged back as unequip.
    Status: 2
  - Category: UI
    Name: Build RelicDragHandler for touch drag and drop
    Description: DONE - Singleton on root canvas. StartDragFromBag and StartDragFromBoard create ghost image following finger. UpdateDrag raycasts to board cells and shows green/red shape preview via RelicBoardUI. HandleBoardDrop calls PlaceOnBoard or TryMergeOnBoard. HandleBagDrop calls RemoveFromBoard. GhostPrefab and GhostSize configurable in inspector.
    Status: 2
  - Category: Combat
    Name: Implement passive stat relic category
    Description: Relics that modify player stats when placed on board and remove modifiers when unequipped. Use RelicStatModifier entries in RelicLevelData.
    Status: 0
  - Category: Combat
    Name: Implement triggered relic category on events
    Description: Relics that proc effects from combat events via IRelicBehavior.OnTrigger. Support cooldown stored on RelicInstance so unequip and re-equip preserves cooldown state.
    Status: 0
  - Category: Combat
    Name: Implement projectile spawning relic category
    Description: Relics that spawn projectiles on a tick interval. OnTick fires if cooldown elapsed. Already-spawned projectiles are independent GameObjects that resolve naturally when relic is unequipped. Cooldown on RelicInstance prevents spam exploit.
    Status: 0
  - Category: Combat
    Name: Implement chain effect relic category
    Description: Multi stage effects where one trigger causes secondary and tertiary effects such as explosion followed by lightning storm ticks.
    Status: 0
  - Category: Performance
    Name: Add pooling for relic spawned projectiles and area effects
    Description: Reuse projectile and area effect objects from a pool to reduce allocations and frame spikes during heavy combat.
    Status: 0
  - Category: Content
    Name: Create first five relic assets for vertical slice
    Description: Author representative starter relics with defined shapes covering passive stat triggered projectile and chain archetypes. Shapes should include at least one 1x1 one 1x2 and one L-shaped relic.
    Status: 0
  - Category: Balancing
    Name: Tune XP curve and relic rarity weights
    Description: Adjust level progression speed and offer probabilities to keep power growth satisfying without runaway scaling. Rarity weights configurable in RelicCatalogueSO or separate BalanceSO.
    Status: 0
  - Category: QA
    Name: Add playmode tests for bag board and merge behavior
    Description: Cover AcquireToBag PlaceOnBoard RemoveFromBoard MergeOnBoard max level cap and shape conflict cases so lifecycle behavior stays stable.
    Status: 0
  - Category: QA
    Name: Validate chain relic interactions and event ordering
    Description: Verify chained effects execute in deterministic order and do not double trigger or miss events.
    Status: 0
